        "node_id": "n_7_7f3bc9",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The error in the previous implementation was due to an incorrect handling of the recursive case. The function was not correctly counting numbers that contain the power of 2 substring. Let's modify the approach to correctly count the numbers containing the power of 2 substring by considering each digit position separately and using dynamic programming to optimize the counting process.",
