      "rev_n_4_c55976_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_4_c55976_1",
        "node_id": "n_4_c55976",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was likely due to an incorrect handling of the `used_digits` set, which may not have been properly tracking the digits of the power of 2 being searched for. Instead of using a set to track used digits, a more straightforward approach is to directly check if the current number contains the substring of the power of 2. This avoids the complexity of managing sets and ensures that the substring check is accurate.",
